const sources=[['hours','授课学时'],['participants','课程人次'],['income','归属培训收入'],['qualifications','有效资质数'],['points','本期积分'],['assessment_score','上一已归档考核分'],['credits','授课学分（教务+超星）']];
const methodOptions=[['','默认公式（积分=原始值×系数；考核=达标比例×权重）'],['ratio','达标比例 × 权重'],['linear','原始值 × 系数'],['tier','分档'],['deduct','扣分'],['bonus','加分']];
const methodNames=Object.fromEntries(methodOptions.filter(([v])=>v).map(([v,l])=>[v,l]));
function tiersText(t){return (t||[]).map(x=>x.min+':'+x.value).join(', ')}
function parseTiers(text){return String(text||'').split(/[,，;；\n]/).map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean).map(r=>{const[min,value]=r.split(/[:：=]/).map(x=>(x||'').trim());if(min===''||value===''||value===undefined)throw Error('分档格式应为“门槛:分值”，多档用逗号分隔，门槛从低到高');return {min,value}})}
function methodControls(c,attr){return `<div class="rule-method"><label class="rule-control"><span>评分方式</span><select ${attr}="method" aria-label="评分方式" title="评分方式">${methodOptions.map(([v,l])=>`<option value="${v}" ${(c.method||'')===v?'selected':''}>${l}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label class="rule-control"><span>分档（门槛:分值，逗号分隔）</span><input ${attr}="tiers" aria-label="分档（门槛:分值，逗号分隔）" title="分档：门槛:分值，逗号分隔" placeholder="分档 如 0:20, 8:60, 20:100" value="${esc(tiersText(c.tiers))}"></label><label class="rule-control"><span>分档计分方式</span><select ${attr}="tier_mode" aria-label="分档计分方式"><option value="score" ${c.tier_mode!=='multiplier'?'selected':''}>命中档直接得分</option><option value="multiplier" ${c.tier_mode==='multiplier'?'selected':''}>命中档系数</option></select></label><label class="rule-control"><span>起始分</span><input ${attr}="base" type="number" step="0.01" aria-label="起始分" title="起始分（扣分默认=权重，加分默认=0）" placeholder="起始分" value="${esc(c.base??'')}"></label><label class="rule-control"><span>计数单位</span><input ${attr}="unit" type="number" min="0.0001" step="0.0001" aria-label="计数单位" title="原始值每满多少计一次" placeholder="每满多少计一次" value="${esc(c.unit??'')}"></label><label class="rule-control"><span>每次扣/加分</span><input ${attr}="per_unit" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" aria-label="每次扣/加分" placeholder="每次扣/加分" value="${esc(c.per_unit??'')}"></label><label class="rule-control"><span>保底</span><input ${attr}="floor" type="number" step="0.01" aria-label="保底" title="保底：本项最低得分" placeholder="保底" value="${esc(c.floor??'')}"></label>${attr==='data-or'?`<label class="rule-control"><span>封顶</span><input data-or="cap" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" aria-label="封顶" title="封顶：本项最高得分（默认=权重）" placeholder="封顶" value="${esc(c.cap??'')}"></label>`:''}</div>`}
function methodSummary(c){if(!c.method)return '默认公式';const parts=[methodNames[c.method]||'扩展评分'];if(c.method==='tier')parts.push((c.tier_mode==='multiplier'?'系数 ':'得分 ')+tiersText(c.tiers));if(['deduct','bonus'].includes(c.method))parts.push(`起始 ${c.base}，每满 ${c.unit} 计 ${c.per_unit}`);if(c.floor!=null&&c.floor!=='')parts.push('保底 '+c.floor);if(c.cap!=null&&c.cap!=='')parts.push('封顶 '+c.cap);return parts.join('；')}
function ruleFieldRelevant(r,points,method,org=false){if(['key','label','source','method'].includes(r))return true;if(org&&['weight','target'].includes(r))return r==='weight'||!method||method==='ratio';if(!method)return org?false:points?['factor','cap'].includes(r):['weight','target'].includes(r);const need={ratio:['weight','target'],linear:['factor'],tier:['tiers','tier_mode'],deduct:['base','unit','per_unit'],bonus:['base','unit','per_unit']}[method]||[];return need.includes(r)||['floor','cap'].includes(r)||(!points&&r==='weight')}
function ruleComponent(row,kind,attr='r'){
 const raw=Object.fromEntries($$(`[data-${attr}]`,row).map(el=>[el.dataset[attr],el.value])),method=raw.method||'',points=kind==='points',base={key:raw.key,label:raw.label,source:raw.source};
 if(attr==='or'&&(!method||method==='ratio')&&!String(raw.target??'').trim())throw Error('目标值必填，请按学校考核细则填写');
 if(!method)return attr==='or'?{...base,weight:raw.weight,target:raw.target}:points?{...base,factor:raw.factor,weight:'0',target:'1',cap:raw.cap||null}:{...base,factor:'1',weight:raw.weight,target:raw.target,cap:null};
 const out=attr==='or'?{...base,weight:raw.weight,target:method==='ratio'?raw.target:(raw.target||'1'),method,...(raw.cap?{cap:raw.cap}:{})}:{...base,method,factor:method==='linear'?(raw.factor||'1'):'1',weight:points?'0':raw.weight,target:method==='ratio'?raw.target:'1',cap:raw.cap||null};
 if(method==='tier'){out.tiers=parseTiers(raw.tiers);out.tier_mode=raw.tier_mode||'score'}
 if(['deduct','bonus'].includes(method)){out.per_unit=raw.per_unit||null;if(raw.unit)out.unit=raw.unit;if(raw.base)out.base=raw.base}
 if(raw.floor)out.floor=raw.floor;
 return out;
}
